# Wiloo Project Context

Wiloo Mobile is the Flutter application for the Wiloo HR and smart timeclock platform.

Target platforms:
- Android
- iOS
- macOS desktop
- future Windows desktop

Backend:
- Existing NestJS API
- Better Auth session-based authentication
- PostgreSQL
- Timeclock module with PIN, QR, NFC and Face AI verification

Do not rewrite the backend.
Do not implement a parallel auth system.
Keep the mobile app aligned with existing API contracts, roles, scopes and tenant rules.
